<title>NETHERLANDS: Endemol in television distribution deal.</title>
<headline>Endemol in television distribution deal.</headline>
<dateline>HILVERSUM, Netherlands 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch television and theatre producter Endemol Entertainment said on Monday it had closed a deal with U.S. television film maker World International Network (WIN).</p>
<p>Endemol will have the exclusive rights to distribute WIN's English language television films in the Benelux, French speaking Europe, Italy, Scandinavia, Portugal, Turkey, Greece, Cyprus, Israel, Eastern Europe including Russia and Africa.</p>
<p>The four year contract will be extended each year by about 20 new titles in various genres, Endemol said. No financial details of the deal were disclosed.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
